# ---
#
# ## {{ H["s4"] }}
#
# **The files that define every run: the three graphs, the noise model with what it leaves out, the benchmark file and the circuits.** Each file is shown, folded, as the repository holds it, except the four [section 2]({{ ref("s2") }}) shows.

# %% [markdown]
